  "description": "Welcome to Heathen Horde \nWelcome to the Heathen Horde Gaming Community designed for new players just getting into the game, and wanting an awesome place to learn and grow.\n\nWhat We&#039;re About\nWe play together, help each other, and grow as a team! We welcome contributors from all countries and nationalities. Feel free to ask questions, join raids, and enjoy the game with everyone! \n\nRaid Hours (Mon-Fri)\nWe&#039;re currently raiding Level 25 M-F (assuming we have the marks)\n\nStarting Raid:  12:05 PM EST \n\nBenefits\nA community of helpful and fun people to chat and work towards common guild goals.\nA place to level, get help, chat and make new friends\n\nRequirements:\n7 Day Inactive - Removed from Guild.\nHelp with daily challenges! This will allow the guild to help level everyone!\nIf you&#039;re inactive without telling anyone for over a week, you will be kicked.",
